@startuml Sequence Diagram - Import Data
skinparam backgroundColor #FEFEFE
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center

title Sequence Diagram - Import Data Excel\nSistem Prediksi Penyebaran DBD

actor Admin
participant Browser
participant "Flask App\n(data.py)" as flask
participant "Excel Parser\n(openpyxl)" as excel
participant "Data\nValidator" as validator
database "Database\n(MySQL)" as db

== Import Data Excel ==

Admin -> Browser : 1: Klik 'Import Data'
Browser --> Admin : 2: Tampilkan form upload

Admin -> Browser : 3: Pilih file Excel (.xlsx)
note left of flask : Note: File Excel harus\nformat .xlsx
Browser -> flask : 4: POST /data/import (multipart/form-data)
flask -> flask : 5: check_allowed_file(filename)
flask -> flask : 6: save_temp_file(upload_folder)
note left of excel : Note: Validasi kolom:\nno_rm, nama, usia, jk, dll
flask -> excel : 7: read_excel_file(file_path)
excel -> excel : 8: parse_rows(sheet)
excel --> flask : 9: return list_of_records

loop [for each record]
    flask -> validator : 10: validate_record(record)
    validator --> flask : 11: return is_valid
end

note left of db : Note: Bulk insert untuk\nperforma lebih cepat
flask -> db : 12: db.session.bulk_insert_mappings()
flask -> db : 13: db.session.commit()
db --> flask : 14: return success_count, error_count
flask --> Browser : 15: flash('Import berhasil: X data')
Browser --> Admin : 16: Tampilkan hasil import

@enduml
